(text "RVB22 RESET: U202 falling3.023950–3.116050V; conservative release threshold max3.193951V.\nCT open delay12–28ms; C203 DNP. R203 limits discharge; monitor source/local rail plus EN.\nNormal transients must remain>3.116050V and<3.6V without unintended reset.\nOpen-drain programmer reset remains compatible; hold GPIO0 through actual EN release.\nExternal EN reset does not uniquely identify its cause. Native and target verification remain required." (at 50.8 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0aa251f5-d326-531b-bfd6-ed97f21fa059"))
